Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.37,0:00:04.98,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wanting to touch the waxing \Nand waning moon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.53,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I reached out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:10.92,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if it was a small, \Ninsignificant step
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.92,0:00:14.96,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I traveled my universe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:21.54,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Believing I'll get there someday
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:28.51,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if I must walk down \Na path never trodden before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:33.38,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if I'm dreaming too big, \Nhoping for too much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:38.11,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My hand traverses \Na 60 centimeter universe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.11,0:00:46.01,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And gets closer to \Nthe bright side of the moon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.96,0:00:48.75,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Watch me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.55,0:00:52.99,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.54,0:00:20.12,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Once one person stopped, \Nmore and more did.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.76,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,People are gathering around my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.17,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:26.56,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm actually being a singer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's loosened up completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:32.51,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.95,0:00:35.91,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,If she can keep \Nthe audience here till the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.91,0:00:39.61,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,this should be a success, \Nand her CD should sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:54.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, that logo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.91,0:00:56.62,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That was "ask for the moon."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:12.88,Main,GIRLMOM,0,0,0,,We should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.88,0:01:15.38,Main,GIRL,0,0,0,,What? Gimme a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.81,0:01:21.79,Main,GIRL,0,0,0,,I'll take one copy of your CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.84,0:01:25.46,Main,WOMAN A,0,0,0,,Um, I'd like one as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:26.90,Main,MAN A,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.90,0:01:29.37,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.25,0:01:36.40,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wow, there's so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:38.38,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.38,0:01:41.12,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The moment I stopped singing \Nfor lots of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:43.68,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,lots of people came forward \Nto listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.32,0:01:53.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Now for my third song, "Half & Half."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.08,0:02:03.61,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I was worried at first, but now \NI'm glad I put on this show.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.87,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Ugh, I hate the sound of drums.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.87,0:02:14.52,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Can you maybe, like, not play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:16.50,Main,DRUMMER,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:19.62,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Okay. So, uh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.62,0:02:21.65,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,We're Celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.65,0:02:24.40,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,It's nearly the first anniversary \Nof our debut,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:27.09,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,so we're doing a surprise show \Nin a memorable place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:28.63,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Not that I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.63,0:02:31.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Come on! They're doing a homecoming \Nconcert here today?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.74,0:02:33.42,Main,WOMAN A,0,0,0,,Whoa, isn't that Celestial?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:34.96,Main,MAN B,0,0,0,,Wow, it's really them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.11,Main,WOMAN B,0,0,0,,It's Hizu-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:37.89,Main,MAN A,0,0,0,,They're performing here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:38.95,Main,MAN C,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:40.08,Main,MAN C,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.91,0:02:44.10,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:47.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's like the universe is out \Nto get me or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.69,0:02:50.27,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,INOHANA RIKKA
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:35.12,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Our first song is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.12,0:04:36.26,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Did it have a title?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:38.40,Main,GUITAR,0,0,0,,It does! You came up with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:39.38,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:41.59,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Anyway, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.40,Main,GUITAR,0,0,0,,You're popping a throat drop now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.78,Main,DRUMMER,0,0,0,,Just let her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.78,0:04:48.77,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Here we go with our first song.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:49.77,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,One, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.03,0:04:59.04,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,How does a three-piece band \Nhave such intensity?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.74,0:05:00.93,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Give me the impulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.93,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,I've traveled a long, long time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:12.71,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Through a darkness \Nthat drowned out my voice
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:17.82,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Walking on and on, \Nas if to find the next stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.82,0:05:25.60,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Of this lonely, lonely thread
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:30.14,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,My voice is buried, down and out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.08,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,So I'll drag it out and shout
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:38.31,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,You only get one flicker, \Nshut everything out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:42.91,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,You only get one shot, \Nblaze a trail and hit your mark
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:48.57,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,You only get one life, \Nwhat will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:52.96,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Make your heart beat \Nin the moment, let it shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.04,0:05:55.38,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Urp. Whoops, I just burped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.76,0:06:06.53,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,I felt I was all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.53,0:06:11.12,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,I failed to even come into my own
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.12,0:06:16.11,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,It all, all comes to end, like it or not
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:23.92,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Then take in the now, now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.66,0:06:28.29,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,If your voice was shut off \Nand locked away
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.29,0:06:30.58,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Unleash it and shout
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.77,0:06:36.70,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,You only get one flicker, \Ngather it all up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:41.30,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,You only get one shot, \Nblaze a trail and rend the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:46.59,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,We only have one life, \Nand that's what we'll choose
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.93,0:06:51.62,Broadcast - Top,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Make your heart beat \Nin the moment, let it shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:20.82,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,That vocalist is insanely good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.48,0:06:04.71,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,O...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.71,0:06:06.53,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay, here's my third song,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.82,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,"Half and Half."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.15,0:06:41.30,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, what is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:44.14,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Acting like I'm clueless
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.59,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But deep down, I know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:50.96,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Because it's obvious
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:57.89,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My world's glittering like \Na page out of a shoujo manga
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:05.32,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't need confidence or reassurance
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:43.08,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka's doing great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:47.20,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Her voice sounds way better \Nthan it did in the first song.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.88,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's doing nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:50.96,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,And yet, this had to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.90,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka's not to blame here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.90,0:06:56.41,Italics - Top,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's my fault for picking this spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.41,0:07:05.74,Flashback Italics,AIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, become a musician with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:10.62,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Aiko was the one \Nwho asked me to join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.19,0:07:14.04,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, why'd you ask me \Nto team up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.81,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Because of your voice, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:17.21,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,It was love at first listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.57,0:07:21.05,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,I knew your voice was a real moneymaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.02,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Money? Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.02,0:07:25.74,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,I had one more reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:30.58,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'm the type to get front-row tickets \Nfor my favorite singer's shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.18,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.18,0:07:32.44,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.34,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,standing next to you is like \Nbeing in your front row.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.88,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,I want to hear your voice \Nfrom as close as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.49,0:07:41.57,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:45.82,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Together, we wrote a song \Ncalled "In the Calm of Night,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.82,0:07:49.45,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and sent the finished version \Nto a record label.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.38,0:07:49.80,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}"IN THE CALM OF NIGHT"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.80,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, they sent a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.83,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,They want to meet us in person!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.83,0:07:55.27,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.02,0:07:59.67,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Man, those were the days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.92,0:08:02.99,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Which one of you sang the chorus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.99,0:08:04.66,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,We only need that girl's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.66,0:08:05.15,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.30,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You can't do this! We worked together—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.40,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Rikka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.18,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.18,0:08:12.32,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Do your best for me too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:19.09,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,She must've had so much to say back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.93,0:08:27.65,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll lock it all up for now and run
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:34.79,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,To where I can hear your voice \Nand you can hear mine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:40.96,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With each sway of my hair, \NI get one step closer
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:44.49,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I can hear my panting and my heartbeat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.49,0:08:47.86,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It must be because I ran so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:51.29,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What should I say first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.29,0:08:57.61,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Something that's like me \Nto say, from me to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.61,0:09:01.35,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I kept thinking all this while...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.43,0:08:29.28,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,She hid them all behind her smile \Nand supported me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.76,0:08:33.30,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but I ran away because of one setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.47,0:08:38.04,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I stayed in my comfort zone,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:40.96,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,sang other people's songs \Nto be fake popular,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.96,0:08:43.59,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,and acted like I hadn't \Ngiven up on music.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:45.48,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,No wonder she got mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.86,0:08:53.85,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I just decided to stop singing \Nfor the masses, but this still stings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:57.61,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh no. If I keep looking down, \NI might actually cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.91,0:08:59.87,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But I just can't look up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.15,0:09:05.32,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you doing, Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.70,0:09:09.22,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I told you, if you're having a hard time \Nand can't keep your head up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:10.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,look in my eyes and nowhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.63,0:09:14.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I made the right call in bringing these.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:16.75,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You could see me \Neven with your teary eyes, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.85,0:09:22.60,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And I told you I'd die of cringe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:24.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Rikka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.51,0:09:26.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you really want it to end this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:28.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Weren't you going to sing \Nfor the person dear to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.78,0:09:32.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you just going to \Nlet your dream die here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.70,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Did you ask her to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.75,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,He was handing out fliers by the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:44.73,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}INOHANA RIKKA\NSTREET PERFORMANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.75,0:09:47.17,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I didn't expect her to show up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:49.86,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm glad I handed it to her just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:10:01.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Aiko, I... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.64,0:10:02.67,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.46,0:10:06.23,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,I came here to listen to you sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:10.33,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,You've never been talkative \Nor had a way with words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:13.47,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,It's easier for me to know \Nwhat you want if you just sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:15.99,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:17.26,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:22.75,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This will be my last number.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:26.54,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I wrote this song for my best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.44,0:10:29.69,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is "trails."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.91,0:10:55.72,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We're walking towards the rainbow, \Nyou said with a smile
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:11:04.75,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With a smile that shined \Nlike a glass marble
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.75,0:11:08.93,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,So I packed everything I could think of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.93,0:11:14.09,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,In this old backpack of mine
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:21.58,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,We can go wherever we want, \Nas far as we want
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:25.42,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Until our hands touch \Nthe base of the rainbow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:29.83,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's go see things never seen before
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.83,0:11:35.93,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Until we wave goodbye \Nat the crossroads someday
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.06,0:11:45.01,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Until we wave goodbye \Nunder the rainbow someday
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.60,0:12:06.18,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What'd you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.24,0:12:09.07,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.07,0:12:09.71,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.71,0:12:11.17,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Where's the encore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:15.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Encore? But I only wrote four new songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:24.70,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,I'm getting tired of this, \Nso can we call it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.57,Main,GUITAR,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.08,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.08,0:12:30.23,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Listen up, you sheeple!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.53,0:12:33.29,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Rikka's gonna sing \N"In the Calm of Night"! Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.29,0:12:35.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.35,0:12:37.64,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Lay off me. Those guys piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.64,0:12:39.20,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why "In the Calm of Night"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.20,0:12:41.14,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,What, did you forget it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.97,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Like I could ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:47.48,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Th-They picked a fight with us! So scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.85,Main,DRUMMER,0,0,0,,Do they want a battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:52.35,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,What, you scared of battling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:55.43,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Bring it, you cowards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.43,0:12:57.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Aiko, quit provoking them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:13:00.24,Main,HIZUMI,0,0,0,,Eek! I-I don't have any money on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.24,0:13:02.36,Main,GUITAR,0,0,0,,How dare they mock us. \NLet's go, Hizumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:04.61,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,It's time for a battle of the bands!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.35,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.35,Main - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Y-Yamabuki-kun, stop Aiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Where are your balls, Celestial?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:10.76,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yamabuki-kun?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:13.54,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You need to show off here \Nand make yourself memorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:15.34,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The spectators are all over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:20.03,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,It don't matter. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.32,0:13:22.91,Broadcast,AIKO,0,0,0,,Here's "In the Calm of Night," \Nspecial arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:26.86,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Arrangement?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:28.60,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Come on, get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:31.96,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Ugh, you're always so bossy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:37.92,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey, Aiko. I'm sorry for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.93,0:13:42.14,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for everything, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:46.64,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Have I gotten any better at singing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:47.75,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,Beats me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:48.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.78,0:13:51.12,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to tell \Nwith just one song?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.83,Main,AIKO,0,0,0,,I'll listen again, but this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.20,0:14:20.22,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,As the sun sank into the sea
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:23.62,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,We let out a deep sigh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:26.51,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And the oceans responded to us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.63,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,With a big white wave
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:37.20,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And dragged the wind away with it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:40.70,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,After we saw it off
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:46.00,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,We made a promise for no reason
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.00,0:14:49.52,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,The calm takes over the night
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:53.31,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,When the calm takes over the night
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.31,0:15:00.04,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,We feel like there's nobody else \Nin the world but us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:03.56,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,The sea blends into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.56,0:15:07.35,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,When the sea quietly blends into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:12.54,Broadcast - Top,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I know it's just the two of us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.54,0:15:17.52,Broadcast - Top,AIKORIKKA,0,0,0,,But I still whisper to you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:25.85,Broadcast - Top,AIKO,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, in the calm of night
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.95,0:15:31.95,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}IN RIKKA'S FRONT ROW
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.66,0:15:34.43,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.39,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ready? Cheers to a good concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.22,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Cheers to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.39,0:15:39.22,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Way to go-Iko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:41.31,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Your show was great, Rikka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.31,0:15:45.32,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,We just happened to be there, okay? \NBy sheer luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.32,0:15:48.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah, a total coincidence. \NMiracles are real, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:49.81,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.81,0:15:51.39,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Try to be less obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.39,0:15:54.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You even managed to sell \Nmore than 20 copies of your CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.31,0:15:55.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That's a huge success.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.74,0:15:58.30,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My quota was 50 copies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.84,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Still, not bad for a first time, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:02.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah. You did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:06.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You should've invited \NAiko-chan to join us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.28,0:16:08.67,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Look, I tried, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.95,0:16:11.14,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Hell nah! I'm too shy for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:13.55,Flashback,AIKO,0,0,0,,Meeting new people is too much for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:15.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,She has all that fire \Nand she's a shy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.74,0:16:18.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll just have a private party \Nwith her later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:21.64,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I'm glad you managed to patch things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:27.29,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:29.11,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I left my wallet in the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:30.21,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.21,0:16:32.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'll go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:33.28,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What a cliché.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.66,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Is it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Want us to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Oh, nah. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.54,0:16:41.14,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Go on, Errand Boy! Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:44.01,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Go with her and do everything \Nin your power to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.17,0:16:47.43,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,See you at school the day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:50.09,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bucky, you'd better not \Ndo anything weird, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.09,0:16:51.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Bye, Rikka!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:54.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What do you mean, weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:16:59.98,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Whoa, the whole car to ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.98,0:17:02.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Lucky me, 'cause my legs are beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:05.19,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wow, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.19,0:17:07.85,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The sun's setting over the sea. \NIt's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.37,0:17:11.19,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a seat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.19,0:17:16.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yours truly remains unseated wherever \Npossible for my lower body health.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.16,0:17:17.87,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,And you had the prime seat \Nnext to me available, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.95,0:17:23.54,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why do you always miss these chances?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:26.48,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It'd be fine if it was \Ndelivered to lost-and-found,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.48,0:17:28.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,but where would we look \Nfor it if it wasn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.86,0:17:31.71,Italics,RIKKA,0,0,0,,He's even more worried \Nabout my wallet than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.82,0:17:36.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That was nerve-racking, but I had fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.72,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,My heart is still racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:40.29,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was a good show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:42.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You did well seeing it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:46.61,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Well, I didn't manage to sell 50 CDs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.52,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but I'm still satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.80,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.40,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I managed to write some good songs, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:59.27,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I never thought giving up on mass appeal \Nto sing for the people I want to reach
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,would be this fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:06.62,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't think I picked the wrong approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.00,0:18:09.25,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.65,0:18:12.53,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.03,0:18:15.84,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Did I really not choose wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.63,0:18:18.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Of course you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:21.50,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You need to have fun before anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:23.06,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I did have fun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:24.46,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,until the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.93,0:18:29.65,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But when the audience \NI'd attracted left me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.65,0:18:33.19,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I felt bitter, sad, and really miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.44,0:18:38.68,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I can say I only sing for \Ncertain people all I want,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:41.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,but it still stings when the audience \Nabandons me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:43.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That wasn't your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:46.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Celestial just happened \Nto do a show nearby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:50.08,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,All it means is that they had my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:53.35,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Music is about popularity, and \Nwe're fighting over the same fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.35,0:18:56.09,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's what it means to live as a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:01.83,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be up for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.24,0:19:04.13,Flashback,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Maybe I expected too much of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:07.74,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:10.63,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Yes, hello. I'm almost at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.15,0:19:12.77,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Yeah, it went great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.76,0:19:15.13,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}INOHANA RIKKA\NSTREET PERFORMANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.15,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you hate rabbits?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:17.66,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Celestial's show went over great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.66,0:19:20.23,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,It's trending on socials, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:24.37,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,Oh, also, there was a high \Nschooler performing nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.14,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,It was kinda interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:28.60,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's a peace sign, not a rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:29.94,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,INOHANA RIKKA\NSTREET PERFORMANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:29.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, what does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.31,0:19:32.92,Main,PRODUCER,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of reaching out to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.94,0:19:35.99,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:38.99,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}A SYMBOL FOR DEFIANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:42.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I wonder if Rikka-chan found her wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.69,0:19:44.68,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The errand boy will take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:46.25,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Wow, you actually trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.49,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.49,0:19:51.57,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But I guess he is handy to have around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.57,0:19:54.01,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'm having him do so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.65,0:19:55.77,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.77,0:19:57.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.87,0:20:00.69,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Iko-chan's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.69,0:20:01.95,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.13,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Anyway, I've got stuff to do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.13,0:20:05.46,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.46,0:20:06.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:07.54,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.37,0:20:18.95,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I don't want to think I chose wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:24.22,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,But maybe everything I've been saying
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.22,0:20:28.57,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,is just an excuse to run away \Nfrom the competition?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:29.56,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Rikka...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.56,0:20:34.31,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Can I really keep \Npursuing music like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.11,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:46.02,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.02,0:20:48.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Forgive me. I deserve the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.33,0:20:49.42,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:53.00,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I should've known there was a chance \NCelestial would show up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:55.43,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If I had researched more thoroughly...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.25,0:20:58.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You did nothing wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.20,0:21:00.95,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your songs, your vocals... \NThey were all good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:03.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is all my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.20,0:21:04.59,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.59,0:21:08.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I wanted this show to become \Na fun memory for you, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:12.02,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You're blaming yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.02,0:21:14.78,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Nobody could've seen that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.78,0:21:17.25,Italics - Top,PA,0,0,0,,The next stop is Kaihin-Makuhari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:20.86,Italics - Top,PA,0,0,0,,Now arriving at Kaihin-Makuhari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.47,0:21:17.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,O-Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.65,0:21:18.63,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.63,0:21:21.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm a Yamabuki! Nobody can see my tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:24.24,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,What are you, famous?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.24,0:21:27.04,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You never know who's watching and where!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.67,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Once you deface your name, \Nfixing it is difficult!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:32.73,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Yeesh. What am I to do with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:35.82,Italics - Top,PA,0,0,0,,The train on platform number one \Nis a local train for Soga.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.42,0:21:37.82,Default,GUY,0,0,0,,Check out the lovebirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:39.42,Main,GIRL,0,0,0,,It's good to be young.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:10.16,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You went above and beyond \Nfor me, Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.16,0:22:12.66,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,The rest was up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.09,0:22:14.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I suck so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.91,0:22:16.27,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.97,0:22:04.89,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}TRANSLATION: SRIRAM GURUNATHAN\NTIMING: MARIANA MARTINEZ\NEDITING: WILLIAM HAGGARD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:10.14,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}QUALITY CHECK: S BILYEU\NTRANSLATION CHECK: MICHELLE TYMON
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.27,0:22:18.79,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Compared to Celestial, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.79,0:22:21.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But you showed more heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.79,0:22:24.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I love your music more.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.26,0:22:30.37,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,You sure that's an opinion \Nmy producer should have?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.74,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Showing more heart\Ndoesn't mean it'll resonate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.74,0:22:34.91,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,That's just pretty, idealistic nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.91,0:22:36.17,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.17,0:22:37.41,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.18,0:22:50.68,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ANCHORING 101
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.44,0:22:57.44,Main - Top,SIGN,0,0,0,,VOICE ACTRESS PERSONALITY QUIZ!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.51,0:23:39.35,Main,ALL,0,0,0,,So very pretty.
